                                "sense_id": "a241d482-caae-3cba-8d56-b4fa6c8c0886",
                                "text": "1864, Illustrirtes Allgemeines Gartenbuch. Vollständige Anleitung … . Ein Handbuch für Gärtner, Gartenfreunde und Landwirthe von H. Jäger, p. 22",
                                "translation": "In some cases, red is said to result from an oxidation of the yellow pigment, which is certainly the case with orange.",
                                "english": "In some cases, red is said to result from an oxidation of the yellow pigment, which is certainly the case with orange."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2ffc45a5-a185-47b7-9cca-811c70aa170c",
                                "sense_id": "a241d482-caae-3cba-8d56-b4fa6c8c0886",
                                "text": "Es ist der einzige Gelbstoff, welcher diese Reaction giebt.",
                                "translation": "It is the only yellow pigment that gives this reaction.",
