                                "sense_id": "a241d482-caae-3cba-8d56-b4fa6c8c0886",
                                "text": "1875, Illustriertes Konversations-Lexikon. Vergleichendes Nachschlagebuch für den täglichen Gebrauch, vol. IV, p. 61 (s.v. Faulbaum)",
                                "translation": "The bark has a laxative effect, as does the berry. Both, including the leaves, are also used as yellow dye, since they contain a particular yellow pigment, rhamnoxanthin.",
                                "english": "The bark has a laxative effect, as does the berry. Both, including the leaves, are also used as yellow dye, since they contain a particular yellow pigment, rhamnoxanthin."
